---
// A CSS-only sketch of the app: the agent chat beside a live preview. Decorative.
---

<figure class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-8 pb-6">
  <div
    class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-tertiary/30 bg-primary/[0.03]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-tertiary/30 px-4 py-3">
      <div class="flex gap-1.5">
        <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary/50"></span>
        <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary/50"></span>
        <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary/50"></span>
      </div>
      <div
        class="mx-auto flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-tertiary/30 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-secondary"
      >
        <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
        orso / my-site — live preview
      </div>
      <div class="w-10"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[3rem_1fr_15rem]">
      <div class="hidden flex-col items-center gap-3 border-r border-tertiary/30 py-4 md:flex">
        {
          ["", "", "", ""].map(() => (
            <span class="size-6 rounded-md bg-primary/10" />
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <div class="bg-primary/[0.03] p-6">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-96 rounded-lg border border-tertiary/30 bg-neutral p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="h-2 w-14 rounded-full bg-tertiary/40"></span>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="h-1.5 w-6 rounded-full bg-tertiary/25"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 w-6 rounded-full bg-tertiary/25"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 w-6 rounded-full bg-tertiary/25"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 space-y-2 text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto h-3 w-4/5 rounded-full bg-tertiary/40"></div>
            <div class="mx-auto h-3 w-3/5 rounded-full bg-tertiary/25"></div>
            <div class="mx-auto mt-3 h-1.5 w-2/3 rounded-full bg-tertiary/25"></div>
            <div class="mx-auto h-1.5 w-1/2 rounded-full bg-tertiary/25"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-5 flex justify-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-6 w-20 rounded-md bg-primary"></span>
            <span class="h-6 w-20 rounded-md border border-tertiary/40"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
            <span class="h-12 rounded-md border border-tertiary/30"></span>
            <span class="h-12 rounded-md border border-tertiary/30"></span>
            <span class="h-12 rounded-md border border-tertiary/30"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden flex-col gap-3 border-l border-tertiary/30 p-4 md:flex">
        <div class="self-end rounded-lg rounded-br-sm bg-primary px-3 py-2 text-xs text-neutral">
          Change the headline to “Built for the whole team.”
        </div>
        <div class="self-start rounded-lg rounded-bl-sm border border-tertiary/30 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-secondary">
          Done — preview it on the left. Publish when you're happy.
        </div>
        <div class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-tertiary/30 px-3 py-2">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-16 rounded-full bg-tertiary/25"></span>
          <span class="ml-auto size-5 rounded-md bg-accent"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="sr-only">
    The Orso app: a conversation with the agent beside a live preview of the site.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
